{"id":"8dd39e9fd83ff83f","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-connectedness-and-unit.md","title":"Theorem — 连通性与伴随单位","display":"Theorem — 连通性与伴随单位","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-connectedness-and-unit","aliases":["14-thm-connectedness-and-unit"],"display":"Theorem — 连通性与伴随单位","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-connectedness-and-unit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-connectedness-and-unit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 连通性与伴随单位"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06765da425264baa\" href=\"?note=06765da425264baa\" title=\"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism\">14-df-connected-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow f_*f^*\">\\(\\eta:1_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow f_*f^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon:f^*f_*\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal F}\">\\(\\varepsilon:f^*f_*\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal F}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunctionData}(f^*,f_*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunctionData}(f^*,f_*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\\)</span>；自然变换采用带源靶三元组。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(\\eta_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(\\eta_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：一般伴随 L⊣R 中 L 全忠实当且仅当单位可逆；由 Hom(LA,LB)≅Hom(A,RLB) 与 Yoneda 对比即得。套用 L=f*。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"06765da425264baa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\eta:1_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow f_*f^*$、$\\varepsilon:f^*f_*\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal F}$ 满足 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]] 的 $\\mathrm{IsAdjunctionData}(f^*,f_*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)$；自然变换采用带源靶三元组。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow f_*f^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon:f^*f_*\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsAdjunctionData}(f^*,f_*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(\\eta_A).","display":true}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-connectedness-and-unit|Theorem — 连通性与伴随单位]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-connectedness-and-unit]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-connectedness-and-unit|Theorem — 连通性与伴随单位]]"},{"id":"260987f5c0df74b8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"证明：一般伴随 L⊣R 中 R 全忠实当且仅当余单位可逆，为[[14-thm-connectedness-and-unit]]的对偶 Hom 论证。套用 R=f_*。"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","06765da425264baa","d2b4e5cf16585f95","d5f547b903550705"]}